OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman found
OL,4,Adead in property
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 31-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a woman was found dead in a
OL,8,Fproperty in Gainsborough.
OL,10,FThe 20-year-old's body was found after
OL,11,Fofficers were called to the address on
OL,12,FHaldane Street just before 10:00 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FLincolnshire Police said the death was
OL,16,Fbeing treated as "unexpected" and
OL,17,Finquiries were continuing to establish
OL,18,Fthe cause.
OL,20,FThe force said there would be a police
OL,21,Fpresence in the area while the
OL,22,Finvestigation was carried out.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
